      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but it feels a little generic. could you maybe add a sentence or two about how their client work is actually setting an example for the rest of the team? i want to highlight that their success with the big accounts is a huge win for the agency. also, can we make the part about the meetings sound a bit more like it's affecting team morale? like, when they aren't there, the whole vibe of the meeting changes.",
